msgstr "En sendt melding flyr fra meldingsfeltet til plassen sin i chatten"

#. Settings > Appearance, description of the "Night" reading theme (font and product names stay as they are)
msgid ""
"A serif in warm parchment tones on brown-black, with little blue. For reading in the dark."
msgstr ""
"En seriffskrift i varme pergamenttoner på brunsvart, med lite blått. For lesing i mørket."

#. settings, value editor description for importing a settings file
msgid ""
"A settings file exported from Clarp (or written by hand): its valid settings are applied, the rest is reported."
msgstr ""
"En innstillingsfil eksportert fra Clarp (eller skrevet for hånd): de gyldige innstillingene tas i bruk, resten rapporteres."

