#. Settings > Appearance, description of the "High contrast" reading theme (font and product names stay as they are)
msgid ""
"Atkinson Hyperlegible 18px, near-black on off-white. For bright rooms, glare and low-DPI screens."
msgstr ""
"Atkinson Hyperlegible 18px, nesten svart på brukket hvit. For lyse rom, gjenskinn og skjermer med lav DPI."

